  "name": "Biomasa",
  "description": "Clinical survey dataset containing geospatial observations. The dataset includes fields for OBJECTID, survey identifier, code, decapoda (biomass or clinical measurement related to Decapoda), and geographic coordinates (longitude and latitude).",
